        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion 25-T8, Flat Iron Half Round Knob with Arched El Tovar Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWith an undeniable rustic appearance, the Flat Iron Knob with El Tovar Rose is built upon historic styles while still borrowing from today's design aesthetics. This knobset is available in antique relic pewter, medium relic bronze, and dark relic bronze finishes. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions for either a 2-3/8 inch or a 2-3/4 inch backset. It will adjust to door thicknesses from 1-1/4 inches to 2 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sandcasting</b> is a process for casting metal in sand molds. The mold is made by packing the sand around a pattern. Molten brass is then poured into a mold cavity formed out of sand. Each sand mold is used only once. The sand is then recycled for the next piece.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Half-Round Knob with Arched Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Fusion 25-T8 American Relic Collection Flat Iron Knob with El Tovar Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 1/2”</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Sandcast Brass</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Flat Iron Knob with El Tovar Rose, Fusion 25-T8",
                "description": "Fusion 25-T8 Flat Iron Knob with El Tovar Rose - With an undeniable rustic appearance, the Flat Iron Knob with El Tovar Rose is built upon historic styles while still borrowing from today's design aesthetics. This knobset is available in antique relic pewter, medium relic bronze, and dark relic bronze finishes. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions for either a 2-3/8 inch or a 2-3/4 inch backset. It will adjust to door thicknesses from 1-1/4 inches to 2 inches.\r\n",
